WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:08.910
My name's Mitchell Varela,

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:10.500
and I'm going to show you how crabs

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.293
clean dirt and grime
from under your toenails.

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:17.850
The types of crabs that I use

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:19.770
are called striped shore crabs,

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:22.050
and they can be found
right on the shoreline

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:24.345
within the rocks, mostly
on the Western side

00:00:24.345 --> 00:00:26.190
of the United States.

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:28.050
They're scavengers, so
they pretty much eat

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:29.460
anything that they can grab,

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:32.010
but their primary diet is algae.

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:34.680
So, the key to attracting crabs

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:37.560
towards your toes is a lot of observing

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:39.480
the crabs that are on the shoreline.

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:41.760
So where I live, in San Diego, California,

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:44.460
there's hundreds, if not
thousands of these crabs.

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:47.700
So you stand there, you can
watch all over where they're at.

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:50.097
And I look for crabs that are actively

00:00:50.097 --> 00:00:51.829
picking algae off the rocks,

00:00:51.829 --> 00:00:53.146
because they're showing me

00:00:53.146 --> 00:00:54.390
that they're very hungry.

00:00:54.390 --> 00:00:56.160
You gotta stand there very patiently,

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.200
but if you put your foot right near

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:00.450
where they're eating off the rock,

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:02.433
10, 20, maybe 30 minutes later,

00:01:02.433 --> 00:01:03.932
they'll slowly come out.

00:01:03.932 --> 00:01:05.580
And if you haven't been moving,

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:07.863
they'll start to try your toes.

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:15.130
Most of the time, I'm out
there for hours at a time.

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:16.950
It's very uncomfortable, but yes,

00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:19.110
you have to stand completely still,

00:01:19.110 --> 00:01:21.273
otherwise they will get scared of you.

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:25.320
So, what the crab is doing is pulling out

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:27.960
a lot of buildup from under the toe.

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:29.960
It's the easiest stuff for them to grab.

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:33.990
There's a lot of testing for the crab.

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:36.330
You'll see it pinching at different things

00:01:36.330 --> 00:01:38.400
just to see what it
can actually grab onto,

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:41.220
because I don't believe they
have very good eyesight.

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:43.200
So I don't think it really knows

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:44.737
what it's grabbing at,

00:01:44.737 --> 00:01:47.253
but it's just reaching for what it can.

00:01:48.990 --> 00:01:50.670
They taste with their toes.

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:53.400
So if it's touching my feet with its toes

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:55.260
to see what I am,

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:57.060
then I know it's somewhat interested.

00:01:57.060 --> 00:01:58.851
But generally you can tell

00:01:58.851 --> 00:02:01.909
within a couple of seconds or minutes

00:02:01.909 --> 00:02:03.933
that a crab is interested or not.

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:07.560
They also can taste with their mouth,

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:11.280
so they have, unlike us,
multiple ways of tasting.

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:13.688
I do not know

00:02:13.688 --> 00:02:16.830
why they find toes appetizing.

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:21.100
I've never asked a crab. But they do.

00:02:23.220 --> 00:02:25.620
So, sometimes, luckily, there's a hangnail

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:28.320
or a little piece of skin on the edge,

00:02:28.320 --> 00:02:29.595
and they really like that.

00:02:29.595 --> 00:02:32.511
But they'll try to go
for the flat surfaces,

00:02:32.511 --> 00:02:35.267
but it doesn't look like
they're grabbing much,

00:02:35.267 --> 00:02:37.050
because they're not.

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:39.990
The feeling I would
describe for a crab pedicure

00:02:39.990 --> 00:02:43.680
is a tugging sensation.

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:45.120
Everybody's feet are different,

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:48.120
but for me there's no pain involved.

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:50.820
It's just a pulling sensation,

00:02:50.820 --> 00:02:54.062
which I find relaxing, weirdly.

00:02:54.062 --> 00:02:57.180
I don't know. [laughs]

00:02:57.180 --> 00:03:00.180
The majority of them
are very afraid of me.

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:01.671
They are very delicate,

00:03:01.671 --> 00:03:04.521
so if you misstep or whatnot,

00:03:04.521 --> 00:03:06.570
it could be a bad day for the crab.

00:03:06.570 --> 00:03:08.805
So, eating human skin
I don't have any proof

00:03:08.805 --> 00:03:10.290
affects them negatively,

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:11.790
because they're scavengers.

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:13.832
I always come from a viewpoint of,

00:03:13.832 --> 00:03:14.931
they eat a lot worse,

00:03:14.931 --> 00:03:16.939
because they'll literally eat dead birds

00:03:16.939 --> 00:03:18.300
that are crammed between rocks,

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:20.250
which I think is a lot worse,

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:24.300
but I am also not a wildlife biologist,

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:27.360
so I don't know 100%.

00:03:27.360 --> 00:03:30.690
As far as I know, there
is no way of getting sick

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:34.650
from the crabs or the
crabs getting sick from me.

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:38.070
There's potential for there being diseases

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:40.080
within a crab, just like anything else.

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:44.400
And so I would never let a
crab pick at an open wound,

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:46.650
I would never let a crab pick at anything

00:03:46.650 --> 00:03:48.330
that's raw on my skin.

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:50.610
But other than that, I
have never had issues

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:51.860
with them my entire life.

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:57.000
The final results of the pedicure

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:59.880
is generally a lot
cleaner under the toenail

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:01.290
and along the sides of the toenail.

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:03.870
So any hangnails are usually gone

00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:05.070
by the time they're done.

00:04:05.070 --> 00:04:07.336
They will clean the top of your toenail

00:04:07.336 --> 00:04:08.520
pretty good too.

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:10.500
They just won't clip
your toenails for you,

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:12.270
and I'm trying to figure that one out,

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:13.920
how they can do that for you too.

